# --- Phase 10's runtime-confound replication (WS-0) ---------------------------
# Two arms of the frozen `matrix` cell -- AEP-full x NO_READBACK x session-3 --
# re-collected under a NATIVE Docker Engine inside the WSL2 distro rather than
# Docker Desktop. The ext4 arm was collected outside the repository tree, on the
# distro's own disk, because the tree is on 9p/drvfs and the frozen cell it
# replicates was collected on ext4; the drvfs arm was collected in place. Both
# are here so the filesystem is separated from the runtime instead of
# confounded with it.
#
# Pre-registered in reports/phase-report-10-prediction-2026-09-02.md, committed
# and pushed at 9b1848b (10:34:00Z) before the first run existed (11:30:32Z).
#
# Same rule as every root above: analysis products and the collection's own
# provenance stamp only -- never a run directory, never a sqlite ledger, never
# a log. COLLECTION-PROVENANCE.json is included because it is what records that
# the ext4 arm's collection path and its committed path differ, which nothing
# else in the tree states.
