# --- Two untracked strays, dispositions recorded rather than guessed --------
#
# /main.bbl -- a 12-byte root-level file containing only 'SCRATCHWINS'. A
# root-level main.bbl is not part of any build: the manuscript's is
# paper/main.bbl, and build_paper.sh stages its own. The sentinel is NOT the
# one tests/test_build_paper_safety.py writes (that one reads
# 'last-known-good bibliography'), so its origin is NOT established and it is
# ignored rather than deleted.
/main.bbl
#
# phase8-driver/.build_keep.sh -- GENERATED, not authored. 
# phase8-driver/verify_f0_in_pdf.sh line 26 writes it by sed-transforming
# scripts/build_paper.sh to disable the cleanup trap, so it is a derived
# artifact that regenerates on demand and goes stale the moment
# build_paper.sh changes -- which it has, repeatedly. Ignored, not committed.
phase8-driver/.build_keep.sh

