# Phase 20 step 3: the pre-WS-5 roots, which were unmonitored precisely
# because they were 'already frozen'. Frozen is not a property that
# protects anything -- docs/25 R16. Each file states, inside itself, the
# date it binds from and that it cannot bind any pass that ran earlier.
#
# Not here: experiments/results/smoke, whose root `make reproduce-smoke`
# rewrites on every invocation -- a tracked digest over it would fail
# --check during ordinary use, and a gate that cries wolf gets ignored.
# Not here either: the sixteen analysis-only roots, which have no run
# directories; the tool now REFUSES those rather than writing a digest of
# the empty string that reads as coverage.
!experiments/results/b2-2026-08-21/RAW-SHA256SUMS
!experiments/results/b2-s1-2026-08-21/RAW-SHA256SUMS
!experiments/results/b2-s2-2026-08-21/RAW-SHA256SUMS
!experiments/results/b2-s3-2026-08-21/RAW-SHA256SUMS
